@ [canonical_uuid] 5a67e2bc-17a6-4207-939e-7a521945dcc6

& [Observed]
  + the initial generic JSON-shape validator refused duplicate string values in every array
  + this correctly protected set-valued evidence unresolved denial and terminal fields but also rejected a valid ordered argv containing a repeated argument

& [Cause]
  + array uniqueness was inferred from JSON value shape without carrying the parent field role

& [Correction]
  + propagate parent field names through bounded-shape validation and enforce uniqueness only for evidence_refs unresolved_account capability_denials and terminal_outcomes
  + add a regression proving a resealed repeated-argv plan round trips while a duplicate terminal-outcome set fails closed

& [Evidence]
  + focused debug and overflow-checked release each pass six tests; warnings-denied focused Clippy format and diff pass

& [NonClaim]
  + no weakening of set uniqueness digest validation authorization correspondence or effect boundaries
